  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2808\">\n<li data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2614\">\n<p data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2292\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2290\">Any Rearrangement Detected (PDGFRA, PDGFRB, FGFR1):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2614\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2408\">\n<p data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2408\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Supports diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"2319\" data-end=\"2405\">Myeloid/Eosinophilic Neoplasm with Tyrosine Kinase Fusion (per WHO classification)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2508\">\n<p data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2508\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May predict response to <strong data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2505\">tyrosine kinase inhibitors (e.g., imatinib for PDGFRA/B fusions)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2614\">\n<p data-start=\"2513\" data-end=\"2614\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Requires correlation with <strong data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2613\">clinical, morphological, and other molecular findings (NGS, karyotype)</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2808\">\n<p data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2650\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2648\">No Rearrangement Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2808\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2653\" data-end=\"2697\">\n<p data-start=\"2655\" data-end=\"2697\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No evidence of the tested fusion events.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2808\">\n<p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2808\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Does not rule out other genetic abnormalities; additional <strong data-start=\"2760\" data-end=\"2790\">NGS or cytogenetic testing</strong> may be warranted.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
